# src/core/ is excluded from clang-format checking.
#
# History: this started as "vendored Microsoft sample code, do not touch".
# That is no longer accurate -- Camera3D, GameObject*, Mouse*, HPTimer,
# COMException, StringHelper and the whole particle system are original
# code that happens to live in the same folder, and as of 2026-09-17 none
# of the 22 files in src/core/ are clang-format clean (Google base style,
# 120 columns). The CI format job is therefore not checking any of the
# project's own C++ yet.
#
# Kept for now, deliberately: the exclusion is lifted per file as code
# migrates out of the sample into src/rhi/ and src/renderer/, which are
# checked. Reformatting the current files wholesale is a separate,
# reviewable commit the owner makes, not something to fold into another
# change (CLAUDE.md: never silently reformat unrelated code).
src/core/*
src/platform/input/*